<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>@@DOMAIN@@ · 企业邮箱</title>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f1ea">
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#f4f1ea; --card:#fffdf9; --ink:#26221d; --muted:#7a7268;
    --line:#e2dbcf; --accent:#b4533a;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{margin:0;padding:0}
  body{
    background:
      radial-gradient(900px 600px at 12% -8%,rgba(180,83,58,.10),transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(700px 500px at 92% 8%,rgba(192,138,62,.12),transparent 62%),
      var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI","PingFang SC","Hiragino Sans GB","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;
    min-height:100vh; display:flex; flex-direction:column;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }
  .wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;width:100%}
  header{padding:28px 0}
  .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}
  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
  .mark{
    width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;display:grid;place-items:center;
    background:linear-gradient(145deg,#c8613f,#8f3f2b);color:#fff;
    font-family:Georgia,"Songti SC",serif;font-size:19px;
    box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(180,83,58,.28);
  }
  .brand b{font-family:Georgia,"Songti SC",serif;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.2px}
  .brand span{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;text-decoration:none;
    padding:11px 20px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;
    background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border:1px solid var(--accent);
    box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(180,83,58,.22);transition:transform .18s ease,box-shadow .18s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(180,83,58,.28)}
  .btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--line);box-shadow:none}
  main{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:40px 0 60px}
  .hero{max-width:720px}
  .eyebrow{
    font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);
    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .eyebrow:before{content:"";width:34px;height:1px;background:var(--accent);opacity:.6}
  h1{
    font-family:Georgia,"Songti SC","Noto Serif SC",serif;
    font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,64px);line-height:1.1;
    letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0 0 22px;
  }
  h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}
  p.lead{font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.85;color:#4d463d;margin:0 0 32px;max-width:600px}
  .actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
  .facts{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));
    gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:56px;
  }
  .fact{background:var(--card);padding:20px 22px}
  .fact b{display:block;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px}
  .fact span{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px 0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
  footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
  @media (max-width:620px){
    .wrap{padding:0 20px}
    header{padding:20px 0}
    .brand span{display:none}
    main{padding:20px 0 40px}
    .facts{margin-top:36px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="wrap nav">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="mark">@@DOMAIN_INITIAL@@</div>
      <div><b>@@DOMAIN@@</b><span>Secure Mail</span></div>
    </div>
    <a class="btn ghost" href="/admin/login">邮箱登录</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">企业邮箱 · 自建 · 加密传输</div>
      <h1>属于 @@DOMAIN@@ 的<br><em>自有邮件系统</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">
        邮件数据存放在自己的服务器上，不经过第三方。支持 IMAP / SMTP 全平台客户端，
        网页端可直接收发、管理账号与组织，全程 TLS 加密。
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn" href="/admin/login">登录邮箱</a>
        <a class="btn ghost" href="/admin/register">申请开通</a>
      </div>
      <div class="facts">
        <div class="fact"><b>TLS 1.2+</b><span>SMTP / IMAP 全程加密，证书自动续期</span></div>
        <div class="fact"><b>SPF · DKIM · DMARC</b><span>反伪造三件套，降低进垃圾箱概率</span></div>
        <div class="fact"><b>自建存储</b><span>邮件只落在自己的服务器上</span></div>
        <div class="fact"><b>网页 + 客户端</b><span>浏览器、手机、Outlook 均可使用</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span>@@DOMAIN@@ 邮件系统</span>
    <span>客户端设置：IMAP @@HOSTNAME@@:@@IMAP_PORT@@ · SMTP @@HOSTNAME@@:@@SMTPS_PORT@@</span>
  </div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
